all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (sentence embedding model and its tokenizer)
    Not included in the helper or its installers: the helper downloads model.safetensors,
    tokenizer.json and config.json from https://cdn.tabmail.ai/releases/models/all-MiniLM-L6-v2/
    the first time semantic search is used. The files are not modified.
    Source: https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
